    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Floating Star, you will play as a lone traveler, floating in the galaxy while exploring the boundaries of human civilization.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel through the boring, dilapidated galaxy, and negotiate with the numb space colonists. Manage supplies, weapons and equipment, defeat enemies, and find the end of your journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by <i>FTL</i>, <i>EVE</i> and some other games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story Driven</strong> -- Somehow, humans have spread to every corner of this galaxy. Negotiate with them to obtain supplies and information. Different choices may bring different consequences.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Random Galaxy</strong> -- Star maps and events will be randomly generated for each game, and the floating path is planned by you.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Strategic Equipment and Resource Management</strong> -- Inventory space and spaceship slots are limited, but the available ammunition, supplies, weapons and equipment are endless! It's up to you to choose.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feel free to make any feedback!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Floating Star, you will play as a lone traveler, floating in the galaxy while exploring the boundaries of human civilization.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel through the boring, dilapidated galaxy, and negotiate with the numb space colonists. Manage supplies, weapons and equipment, defeat enemies, and find the end of your journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by <i>FTL</i>, <i>EVE</i> and some other games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story Driven</strong> -- Somehow, humans have spread to every corner of this galaxy. Negotiate with them to obtain supplies and information. Different choices may bring different consequences.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Random Galaxy</strong> -- Star maps and events will be randomly generated for each game, and the floating path is planned by you.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Strategic Equipment and Resource Management</strong> -- Inventory space and spaceship slots are limited, but the available ammunition, supplies, weapons and equipment are endless! It's up to you to choose.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feel free to make any feedback!</p>",
